{"operations":[{"content":"# Core hours\n\nCore working hours are from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026[[cite:obs-3019ad1999a71f2c7ef7e467cbe37b454cb50786 \"Core hours are set from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026.\"]].\n\nWhere the board resolution of 15 September 2026 and the staff handbook differ, the resolution applies[[cite:obs-3019ad1999a71f2c7ef7e467cbe37b454cb50786 \"Core hours are set from 09:00 to 15:00 on working days, effective 1 October 2026.\"]].\n","expected_sha256":"f2026d83240933ca5028e2f8315988b79f661f60630e374d3a1d88ba5e04b9c6","kind":"modify","path":"doc/hours.md"}],"rationale":"Removed the statement quoting the staff handbook hours (10:00 to 16:00) to comply with the requirement that where the board resolution and staff handbook differ, the resolution applies, and no contradictory hours should be stated. Kept only the board resolution hours with correct citation."}